{"1601020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rawshire The Last Hatchling", "steam_appid": 1601020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/93105e91c2f14400cda9b5acd4565a20.avif?t=1750678938\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><strong>Is an action adventure collectathon that allows you to level up your character, unlock new abilities, take on gigantic mythical Boss', solve puzzles spanning over 6 unique environments, and uncover the truth about who you are. Every choice matters and every action shapes your characters appearance and skills. </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/de87dc9e801c7bbe5cc39440f6a8c711.avif?t=1750678938\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/7197fdcc8f0e56c244ad3884ca0613e5.poster.avif?t=1750678938\" width=636 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/7197fdcc8f0e56c244ad3884ca0613e5.webm?t=1750678938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/7197fdcc8f0e56c244ad3884ca0613e5.mp4?t=1750678938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Every action you take will shape who you are! An infamy system allows the look of the character to change based on the choices that you make!<br>The Infamy system also drives the skill system in Rawshire. As you collect items and progress through the game, your player will gain experience, level up and unlock new abilities to help you overcome new challenges.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/6d00ffb92edd87c9ce4149a7e3c282a3.avif?t=1750678938\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/2d1c109a3cdccddb49940565d6b41c38.poster.avif?t=1750678938\" width=700 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/2d1c109a3cdccddb49940565d6b41c38.webm?t=1750678938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/2d1c109a3cdccddb49940565d6b41c38.mp4?t=1750678938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Scattered throughout Rawshire are the dragon treasures of old. Collect the precious metals (bronze, silver, and gold) to rebuild those stores of wealth! </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/38055b2bb3c424c85576d18f719315df.avif?t=1750678938\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/a16182ea0953819102751cef8b755bc7.poster.avif?t=1750678938\" width=704 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/a16182ea0953819102751cef8b755bc7.webm?t=1750678938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/a16182ea0953819102751cef8b755bc7.mp4?t=1750678938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>There are six unique environments to traverse through with multiple levels in each. Solve puzzles and fight enemies to uncover the secrets of Rawshire. Use the portals in Rawshire to replay levels or find lost souls.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/9592ffa503cfac5e4f9752e8d793935f.avif?t=1750678938\" width=616 height=80 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/5f87d2b9a51ede27f610a80979ce8999.poster.avif?t=1750678938\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/5f87d2b9a51ede27f610a80979ce8999.webm?t=1750678938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/5f87d2b9a51ede27f610a80979ce8999.mp4?t=1750678938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Defeat the Guardians and earn your way to the top of the Mountain. Five evil Guardians have a hold on Rawshire. Use your skills and abilities to fight your way through and avenge Rawshire.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERVIEW</h2><strong>Rawshire the Last Hatchling offers a casual adventure experience. With an interactive world and many choices throughout, Rawshire offers unique experiences every playthrough! Play your way every time! With multiple endings it is an adventure worth taking twice!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/a4df1a170f83be33af5a38429f18f282.avif?t=1750678938\" width=616 height=150 /></span><br><br><strong>Proudly developed and produced by Perpetual Reality Studios Inc. (A solo developer)</strong>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1601020/extras/93105e91c2f14400cda9b5acd456